    new "Even the mistress of a grand estate has the right to be cared for when hurt, Seraphina. To be human is to possess vulnerability."

    old "Seraphina memalingkan pandangannya sejenak ke arah semak mawar dengan senyuman yang teramat manis dan malu-malu, namun jemarinya tidak ditarik dari genggamanku."
    new "Seraphina averted her gaze toward the rose bushes with a tender, bashful smile, yet she did not pull her fingers from my hand."

    old "Terima kasih, Guest... Saputanganmu sangat wangi dan nyaman."
